s=\"above-content-wrapper\">\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"row main-content main-content col-count-1\" id=\"main-content-container\" dynamic-grid>\n<section id=\"main-content\" col-count-1=\"12\" col-count-2=\"9\" col-count-3=\"6\" class=\"col-md-12\">\n<div data-panel=\"content\" data-max-columns=\"4\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-full mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.sectioncoverimage-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"cover-outer-container\">\n<div class=\"cover-image-container cover-container slightly-dark\">\n<img class=\"pat-cover\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/fbi-jacksonville-special-agent-lauren-regucci.jpg/@@images/image\" alt=\"FBI Jacksonville Special Agent Lauren Regucci\">\n<div class=\"cover-image-background\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"cover-image-content col-md-6  blue-background\">\n<h3></h3>\n<h1>We protect the American people and uphold the U.S. Constitution.</h1>\n<h2>You can report suspicious activities and crime by contacting us 24/7 at tips.fbi.gov.</h2>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"align-right\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/tips\">Submit Tips</a></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h2><br></h2><h2>I Want To</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-leftmost iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/help-the-fbi-find-fugitives-and-missing-persons.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted\">Help Find Fugitives &amp; Missing Persons</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-third iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/submit-a-tip.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us\">Submit a Tip</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-two-thirds iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/jobs\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/apply-for-an-fbi-job.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/jobs\">Apply for an FBI Job</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-leftmost iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/more-fbi-services-and-information/identity-history-summary-checks\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/get-a-rap-sheet.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/more-fbi-services-and-information/identity-history-summary-checks\">Get a Rap Sheet (Identity History)</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-third iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left middle-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/contact-the-fbi.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body middle-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us\">Contact the FBI</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-two-thirds iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/more-fbi-services-and-information/ucr\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/find-crime-stats.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/more-fbi-services-and-information/ucr\">Find Crime Stats</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-leftmost iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/scams-and-safety\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/protect-yourself-from-common-crimes-and-scams.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/how-we-can-help-you/scams-and-safety\">Learn About Common Crimes &amp; Scams</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-third iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/investigate\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/learn-what-the-fbi-investigates.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/investigate\">Learn What the FBI Investigates</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-two-thirds iconlink-tile-parent col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.iconlink-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"icon-link-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"media-left top-align\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/history\">\n<img class=\"media-object\" src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/image-repository/discover-fbi-history.jpg/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"...\">\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"media-body top-align\">\n<h4 class=\"media-heading\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/history\">Discover FBI History</a>\n</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"++theme++fbigov.theme/js/components/icon-link.js\"></script></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-full mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top mosaic-tile-padding-bottom\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<p><br></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-full mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile mosaic-tile-padding-bottom\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h2>Featured Content</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-quarter mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-3\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.feature-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"featured-content featured-content-fieldoffice-featurednews\n                portal-type-story\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-financially-motivated-sextortion-threat\">The Financially Motivated Sextortion Threat</a></h3>\n<div class=\"image-tile-container landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-financially-motivated-sextortion-threat\">\n<div class=\"focuspoint\" data-h=\"1156\" data-scale=\"thumb\" data-scales-info=\"{&quot;thumb&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 128, &quot;h&quot;: 72}, &quot;high&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 1400, &quot;h&quot;: 793}, &quot;icon&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 32, &quot;h&quot;: 18}, &quot;mini&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 200, &quot;h&quot;: 113}, &quot;large&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 768, &quot;h&quot;: 435}, &quot;listing&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 16, &quot;h&quot;: 9}, &quot;tile&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 64, &quot;h&quot;: 36}, &quot;preview&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 400, &quot;h&quot;: 226}}\" data-focus-y=\"-0.0\" data-focus-x=\"0.0\" data-base-url=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-financially-motivated-sextortion-threat/@@images/image/\" data-w=\"2040\"><img class src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-financially-motivated-sextortion-threat/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"The Financially Motivated Sextortion Threat\"></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"description\"><p>The FBI this week issued a new warning about an evolving online threat targeting minors and young adults: financially motivated sextortion.</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-quarter mosaic-position-quarter col-md-3\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.feature-tile mosaic-tile-padding-right mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"featured-content featured-content-fieldoffice-featurednews\n                portal-type-story\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/year-in-review-2023\">Year in Review 2023</a></h3>\n<div class=\"image-tile-container landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/year-in-review-2023\">\n<div class=\"focuspoint\" data-h=\"1080\" data-scale=\"thumb\" data-scales-info=\"{&quot;thumb&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 128, &quot;h&quot;: 72}, &quot;high&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 1400, &quot;h&quot;: 787}, &quot;icon&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 32, &quot;h&quot;: 18}, &quot;mini&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 200, &quot;h&quot;: 112}, &quot;large&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 768, &quot;h&quot;: 432}, &quot;listing&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 16, &quot;h&quot;: 9}, &quot;tile&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 64, &quot;h&quot;: 36}, &quot;preview&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 400, &quot;h&quot;: 225}}\" data-focus-y=\"-0.330857496995\" data-focus-x=\"-0.680530192057\" data-base-url=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/year-in-review-2023/@@images/image/\" data-w=\"1920\"><img class src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/year-in-review-2023/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"Year in Review 2023\"></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"description\"><p>A look back at some of the FBI's accomplishments and challenges in 2023.</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-quarter mosaic-position-half col-md-3\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.feature-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"featured-content featured-content-featurednews\n                portal-type-person\" style>\n<h3 class=\"header\">Most Wanted: Case of the Week</h3>\n<div class=\"image-tile-container landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/wcc/darren-anthony-robinson\">\n<div class=\"focuspoint\" data-h=\"692\" data-scale=\"thumb\" data-scales-info=\"{&quot;thumb&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 128, &quot;h&quot;: 156}, &quot;high&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 1400, &quot;h&quot;: 1714}, &quot;icon&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 32, &quot;h&quot;: 39}, &quot;mini&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 200, &quot;h&quot;: 244}, &quot;large&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 768, &quot;h&quot;: 940}, &quot;listing&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 16, &quot;h&quot;: 19}, &quot;tile&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 64, &quot;h&quot;: 78}, &quot;preview&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 400, &quot;h&quot;: 489}}\" data-focus-y=\"-0.0\" data-focus-x=\"0.0\" data-base-url=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/wcc/darren-anthony-robinson/@@images/image/\" data-w=\"565\"><img class src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/wcc/darren-anthony-robinson/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"DARREN ANTHONY ROBINSON\"></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/wcc/darren-anthony-robinson\">DARREN ANTHONY ROBINSON</a></h3>\n<div class=\"description\"><p>Wire Fraud; Money Laundering</p></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-quarter mosaic-position-three-quarters col-md-3\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.feature-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\">\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"featured-content featured-content-fieldoffice-featurednews\n                portal-type-document\">\n<h3><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/capitol-violence\">Capitol Violence</a></h3>\n<div class=\"image-tile-container landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/capitol-violence\">\n<div class=\"focuspoint\" data-h=\"1189\" data-scale=\"thumb\" data-scales-info=\"{&quot;thumb&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 128, &quot;h&quot;: 76}, &quot;high&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 1400, &quot;h&quot;: 832}, &quot;icon&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 32, &quot;h&quot;: 19}, &quot;mini&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 200, &quot;h&quot;: 118}, &quot;large&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 768, &quot;h&quot;: 456}, &quot;listing&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 16, &quot;h&quot;: 9}, &quot;tile&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 64, &quot;h&quot;: 38}, &quot;preview&quot;: {&quot;w&quot;: 400, &quot;h&quot;: 237}}\" data-focus-y=\"0.347935486575\" data-focus-x=\"-0.767216938273\" data-base-url=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/capitol-violence/@@images/image/\" data-w=\"2000\"><img class src=\"https://www.fbi.gov/wanted/capitol-violence/@@images/image/thumb\" alt=\"Capitol Violence\"></div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"description\"><p>The FBI is seeking to identify individuals involved in the violent activities that occurred at the U.S. Capitol and surrounding areas on January 6, 2021. View photos and related information here. If you have any information to provide, visit tips.fbi.gov or call 1-800-CALL-FBI.</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-full mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-12\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile mosaic-tile-padding-bottom mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h2>News</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-row row\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-leftmost col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h3>Stories</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.listing-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-tile  simple\" style>\n<div class=\"items simple\">\n<ul class=\"large-block-grid-1 medium-block-grid-1 latest-news\">\n<li class=\"portal-type-story\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-financially-motivated-sextortion-threat\">The Financially Motivated Sextortion Threat</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">The FBI this week issued a new warning about an evolving online threat targeting minors and young adults: financially motivated sextortion.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-story\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.09.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/fbi-nsa-leaders-talk-election-security-power-of-collaboration-at-fordham-iccs\">FBI, NSA Leaders Talk Election Security, Power of Collaboration at Fordham ICCS</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">FBI Director Christopher Wray on January 9 said the Bureau is well-postured to defend against foreign interference heading into the 2024 election cycle, despite the growing number of foreign actors and nation-states seeking to disrupt our democratic process.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-story\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.08.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/the-search-for-cathy-davidson\">The Search for Cathy Davidson</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">The FBI seeks to bring closure in the 50-year-old case of Cathy Davidson, who was 6 years old when she was reported missing in Michigan, on September 1, 1973.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-story\">\n<p class=\"date\">12.22.2023</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories/year-in-review-2023\">Year in Review 2023</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">A look back at some of the FBI's accomplishments and challenges in 2023.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"read-more\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/stories\">More</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-third col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h3>Podcasts</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.listing-tile mosaic-tile-padding-top mosaic-tile-padding-left\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-tile  simple\" style>\n<div class=\"items simple\">\n<ul class=\"large-block-grid-1 medium-block-grid-1 latest-news\">\n<li class=\"portal-type-document\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.05.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/podcasts/inside-the-fbi-searching-for-joshua-garcia-010524\">Inside the FBI Podcast: Searching for Joshua Garcia</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">Joshua Garcia was nearly 2 years old when he was kidnapped 20 years ago in Mexico City. Today, the FBI is offering a $20,000 reward for information leading to Joshua's recovery.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-document\">\n<p class=\"date\">12.22.2023</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/podcasts/inside-the-fbi-pan-am-flight-103\">Inside the FBI Podcast: Pan Am Flight 103</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">It&#8217;s been 35 years since the tragic aircraft bombing on December 21, 1988. In this episode, we&#8217;ll look back on one of the largest and most complex acts of international terrorism ever investigated by the FBI.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-document\">\n<p class=\"date\">12.01.2023</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/podcasts/inside-the-fbi-charity-scams\">Inside the FBI Podcast: Charity Scams</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">On this episode of Inside the FBI, we&#8217;ll learn how charity fraud scams work, how to avoid being conned, and how to report suspected incidents to the Bureau.</p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-document\">\n<p class=\"date\">11.17.2023</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/podcasts/inside-the-fbi-the-importance-of-partner-engagement\">Inside the FBI Podcast: The Importance of Partner Engagement</a></p>\n<p class=\"description\">On this episode of Inside the FBI, we&#8217;ll hear from Robert J. Contee III, assistant director of the FBI's Office of Partner Engagement.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"read-more\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/podcasts\">More</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mosaic-grid-cell mosaic-width-third mosaic-position-two-thirds col-md-4\">\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-plone.app.standardtiles.rawhtml-tile mosaic-tile-padding-left\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<h3>Press Releases</h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"movable removable mosaic-tile mosaic-fbigov.theme.listing-tile mosaic-tile-padding-left mosaic-tile-padding-top\">\n<div class=\"mosaic-tile-content\">\n<div class=\"castle-tile-wrapper\"><div class=\"list-tile  simple\" style>\n<div class=\"items simple\">\n<ul class=\"large-block-grid-1 medium-block-grid-1 latest-news\">\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.17.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/former-banking-executive-pleads-guilty-to-evading-anti-money-laundering-regulations\">Former Banking Executive Pleads Guilty to Evading Anti-Money Laundering Regulations</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/sextortion-a-growing-threat-targeting-minors\">Sextortion: A Growing Threat Targeting Minors</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us/field-offices/detroit/news/fifteen-people-sentenced-for-defrauding-unemployment-insurance-agencies-during-covid-19-pandemic\">Fifteen People Sentenced for Defrauding Unemployment Insurance Agencies During COVID-19 Pandemic</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us/field-offices/denver/news/colorado-resident-charged-with-federal-hate-crimes-and-firearm-offense-related-to-mass-shooting-at-club-q\">Colorado Resident Charged With Federal Hate Crimes and Firearm Offense Related to Mass Shooting at Club Q</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/lyonel-myrthil-named-special-agent-in-charge-of-the-new-orleans-field-office\">Lyonel Myrthil Named Special Agent in Charge of the New Orleans Field Office</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/sanjay-virmani-named-special-agent-in-charge-of-the-counterterrorism-division-washington-field-office\">Sanjay Virmani Named Special Agent in Charge of the Counterterrorism Division at the Washington Field Office</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.16.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases/david-j-scott-named-special-agent-in-charge-of-the-crimincal-cyber-division-washington-field-office\">David J. Scott Named Special Agent in Charge of Criminal/Cyber Division at the Washington Field Office</a></p>\n</li>\n<li class=\"portal-type-pressrelease\">\n<p class=\"date\">01.12.2024</p>\n<p class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/contact-us/field-offices/washingtondc/news/oregon-man-sentenced-to-prison-on-felony-and-misdemeanor-charges-related-to-january-6-capitol-breach\">Oregon Man Sentenced to Prison on Felony and Misdemeanor Charges Related to January 6 Capitol Breach</a></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p class=\"read-more\">\n<a href=\"https://www.fbi.gov/news/press-releases\">More</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\