          "headersSize": 474,
          "postData": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "params": [],
            "text": "{\"federalViolation\":\"Counterterrorism\",\"specificViolation\":\"Terrorism\",\"reportedAgency\":{\"agencyName\":\"Social Security Administration - Office of Inspector General\",\"dateOfReport\":\"01/18/2024\",\"address\":{\"state\":\"CA\",\"country\":\"USA\"}},\"people\":[{\"personType\":\"complainant\",\"isBusiness\":false,\"emails\":[\"mark.brito@gmail.com\"],\"phones\":[{\"phoneType\":\"mobile\",\"phone\":\"4245818016\",\"phoneInternational\":false}],\"addresses\":[{\"addressType\":\"home\",\"address\":\"Homeless\",\"city\":\"Oxnard\",\"state\":\"CA\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"zip\":\"93030\"}],\"firstName\":\"Mark\",\"middleName\":\"Duane\",\"lastName\":\"Brito\",\"birthDate\":\"09/23/1975\"},{\"personType\":\"subject\",\"isBusiness\":false,\"phones\":[{\"phoneType\":\"mobile\",\"phone\":\"4086499898\",\"phoneInternational\":false}],\"addresses\":[{\"addressType\":\"home\",\"address\":\"3160 Jerrold Zanzi Lane\",\"city\":\"Tracy\",\"state\":\"CA\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"zip\":\"95377\"}],\"firstName\":\"Jennifer\",\"lastName\":\"Tran\",\"approximateAge\":\"39\"},{\"personType\":\"subject\",\"isBusiness\":true,\"emails\":[\"elizabeth.milian@fultongardenspostacute.com\"],\"phones\":[{\"phoneType\":\"business\",\"phone\":\"2094662066\",\"phoneInternational\":false}],\"addresses\":[{\"addressType\":\"business\",\"address\":\"537 E Fulton St\",\"city\":\"Stockton\",\"state\":\"CA\",\"country\":\"USA\",\"zip\":\"95204\"}],\"businessName\":\"Fulton Gardens Post Acute\"}],\"violationQuestions\":[{\"question\":\"Is the subject associated with a group?\",\"answer\":\"yes\",\"subQuestions\":[{\"question\":\"What group?\",\"answer\":\"unknown\"},{\"question\":\"What is the group’s goal/objective?\",\"answer\":\"Financial Gain, Political Control, Electronic and Computer Control, Racism, Hate Crimes, Anticompetitive, Defamation, Destroying Lifes of Americans, National Security\"}]},{\"question\":\"Does the subject or group have access to weapons?\",\"answer\":\"yes\",\"subQuestions\":[{\"question\":\"What kind of weapons and how many?\",\"answer\":\"Primarily electronic interference and software hacking weapons. Deadly signals. \"}]},{\"question\":\"Why do you believe the subject or group is involved in terrorism?\",\"answer\":\"I recorded and analyzed cellular and wifi packet captures. Jamming of TV, Radio, WiFi, Cellular and Bluetooth flooding.  Breaking and entering. Vandalism of my automobile. Stealing many items.  \"},{\"question\":\"Is there a planned attack or threats of an attack?\",\"answer\":\"unknown\"},{\"question\":\"Does the subject/group have an online presence to communicate?\",\"answer\":\"yes\",\"subQuestions\":[{\"question\":\"What platform?\",\"answer\":\"Apple\"}]},{\"question\":\"How do you know this information?\",\"answer\":\"Nonobtrusive bluetooth scan.  I have retained the scan results as well as many chrome network captures and many netguard, tshark and pcapng wireshark packet captures, some decrypted.\"},{\"question\":\"Provide a brief description of the incident\",\"answer\":\"After moving to 3160 Jerrold Zanzi Lane, Tracy,CA 95377 problems with cellular, wifi, hdtv and radio arised.  Esppionage is likely, as it was obvious that personal belongings were being stole, 3 cameras were stolen, and we staryed getting fradulent transactions. A thug moved in and eventually all my items were either stolen or destroyed so I decided to move and a few days later I was messaged on Jennifer Tran's phone number stating \\\"I noticed you haven't been here in 2 days, I am cleaning your room.\\\" My car interior was urinated on and smelled like homeless people.   My automobile was severely vandalized and the transmission almost failed. For the month of January, my mother in a nursing home failed to receive her social security payment of approximately $1,500.  All of my debit cards were skimmed.  95 percent of all calls to my mother from any family member fail.  My mother's nusreing home doesn't return calls, ignores emails, hangs up when I ask for the phone number to the ombudsman.\"}],\"verifySection1001\":true,\"recaptchaCode\":\"03AFcWeA5fRpGm3rUKZ5WYtcXJq5bYkonztp7sucJzAAJ9Qli7FUlDOiMRSlg_aJTIRQKaJv-dqMk1BY4BRURPL-OkKAOFMLQl7F6BMO5pH3bSPSw4i0LgGJ3ELB9gtgehl6pU9VptvWycdMP2PuQYYHjbozjRer0T_haBa4HYa1uxHfl9_oPR0CDQXgig2pCUDiH7h2P7QEUUG97c3HT10YyVCKRP4CzHNnmbLWAGDKP6XOBYLljkPS9uAZr54RxOgU-FDmVnCbpCkCJUJZE_FRJ5N2SE-ypc3ZF4hsnILz1mayQLAkX-VEQaEpPchP7aB2myL2FxZJyTQu8p_IIPSkBnyDtrC5NlGfVpF25zOFPuPGqmM0xmRf2pBmQ5pOE_enIgD6CjIGCIcEPt1Nd4S1CHPSyzQoUHzlnQPCtI_oAa_f3OnhQiDvwRnmWirkERIc12RWSmQIu8JG2NvOrlMbjvjKUFalviB3TDJr9pEXDdkBkWRg05IsXmUpZMN4NeHONWZ4jUuBAA_jqoRHqxVUN_HOBnrEQaubpIqHkg5RdJBVn-cckJN9TOXMsEDEhY-3_bHlgI9jw_\"}"
          }
        },
